 href=\"/wiki/%E9%AC%83%E6%AF%9B%E6%B2%99%E7%A0%BE\" title=\"鬃毛沙砾\"><img alt=\"鬃毛沙砾\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/HeadIconSmall-307201.png/100px-HeadIconSmall-307201.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/b3/HeadIconSmall-307201.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E9%AC%83%E6%AF%9B%E6%B2%99%E7%A0%BE\" title=\"鬃毛沙砾\">鬃毛沙砾</a></span></span></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">实装版本：</span>2.2</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:3em\">来源：</span>银行</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">所属系列：</span>保利斯塔纳热浪</div></div><div><div class=\"grey-small test-hide hide-m\">编号ID：307203</div></div></div></div><div class=\"skin-video tabber\"><h2><span id=\".E8.A7.86.E9.A2.91.E9.A2.84.E8.A7.88\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"视频预览\">视频预览</span></h2><div class=\"tabber-filter\" style=\"margin:0 -3px 4px -3px\"><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button selected\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"4\">技能1</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"3\">技能2</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"2\">大招</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"1\">入场</div></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"4\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3072/307203/一技能.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3072/307203/一技能 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"3\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3072/307203/二技能.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3072/307203/二技能 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\" style=\"display:none\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"2\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3072/307203/大招.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3072/307203/大招 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\" style=\"display:none\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"1\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3072/307203/入场.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3072/307203/入场 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\" style=\"display:none\"></div></div><h2><span id=\".E7.AA.97.E4.B8.AD.E4.BE.A7.E5.86.99_Garment_Display\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"窗中侧写_Garment_Display\">窗中侧写<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">Garment Display</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"infopad\">20世纪初，玛瑙斯因为橡胶而繁荣。工人们割开胶树，用那些乳白的汁液换取黄金。他们的愿望成真了，来源于森林的财富沿着亚马孙河的通路汇聚而来。劳动换来了收获，家中的孩子终于可以不再忍饥挨饿。<br />随着财富一起到来的，还有数不尽的游客。他们急于目睹森林所造就的伟业，急于目睹粉色的河豚、金刚鹦鹉，还有口耳相传的“库鲁皮拉”。<br />一辆来自旁遮普邦的探险车驶入了森林。探险者在泥沼上看见了美洲豹的足迹，进而得知了它背上的花纹是如何排布，捕猎的身姿是如何敏捷。他们又险些落入蟒蛇的肚腹，借以某一瞬间的机智才摆脱了危险。<br />森林沉默地俯瞰着人类的闯入，正如它多年前目睹人类的离开。</div><div id=\"崭新单品\"></div><h2><span id=\".E5.B4.AD.E6.96.B0.E5.8D.95.E5.93.81_All-new_Item\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"崭新单品_All-new_Item\">崭新单品<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">All-new Item</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"char-item-box0 tabber\"><div class=\"char-item-box1 tabber-item\" data-skinid=\"307203\"><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-307204.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/d/d0/Belonging-307204.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">黄色镜片太阳镜<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Yellow-Tinted Sunglasses</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"利齿子儿\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Value-2.png/27px-Value-2.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"利齿子儿\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/62/Value-2.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />5<hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>在当地杂货店购买的黄色镜片太阳镜，并不比普通墨镜有更显著的保护效果。受访者单纯认为明亮的颜色与原始的热带雨林更相宜，以及足够便宜。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-307205.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/6f/Belonging-307205.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">“玛瑙斯的气息”<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">\"A Touch of Manaus\"</div></div></div><div>无估值<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到60%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>重新漆上油彩的义肢，低调的配色能避免引起雨林朋友的注意，用棉布来加固的做法亦可降低与大型动物相处时发生意外的风险。<br />“嘿，这儿的一切都和过去那片山麓不一样，我已经迫不及待要跟它们一起跳舞了！”显然，它的主人已经找到了新的乐趣。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-307206.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/0/03/Belonging-307206.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">古牙项链<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Antique Tooth Necklace</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"雨滴\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/Value-1.png/27px-Value-1.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"雨滴\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/bb/Value-1.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />3<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到100%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>某类南美肉食性动物的牙齿。猎获物不一定就是狩猎得来，它也可以是友谊的证明——当然，亦可在囊中羞涩时向当地摊贩卖出一个好价钱。</div></div></div></div></div><h2><span id=\".E8.A1.A3.E7.9D.80.E6.B5.B7.E6.8A.A5\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"衣着海报\">衣着海报</span></h2><div style=\"display:flex; gap:10px; border:1px solid #b55829; width:fit-content\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%8E%9B%E7%91%99%E6%96%AF%E5%8D%B0%E8%BF%B91.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"衣着 玛瑙斯印迹1.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e9/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%8E%9B%E7%91%99%E6%96%AF%E5%8D%B0%E8%BF%B91.jpg/228px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%8E%9B%E7%91%99%E6%96%AF%E5%8D%B0%E8%BF%B91.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"228\" height=\"325\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e9/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%8E%9B%E7%91%99%E6%96%AF%E5%8D%B0%E8%BF%B91.jpg/342px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%8E%9B%E7%91%99%E6%96%AF%E5%8D%B0%E8%BF%B91.jpg 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e9/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%8E%9B%E7%91%99%E6%96%AF%E5%8D%B0%E8%BF%B91.jpg/456px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%8E%9B%E7%91%99%E6%96%AF%E5%8D%B0%E8%BF%B91.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"1540\" /></a><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%8E%9B%E7%91%99%E6%96%AF%E5%8D%B0%E8%BF%B92.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"衣着 玛瑙斯印迹2.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/df/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%8E%9B%E7%91%99%E6%96%AF%E5%8D%B0%E8%BF%B92.jpg/228px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%8E%9B%E7%91%99%E6%96%AF%E5%8D%B0%E8%BF%B92.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"228\" height=\"325\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/df/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%8E%9B%E7%91%99%E6%96%AF%E5%8D%B0%E8%BF%B92.jpg/342px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%8E%9B%E7%91%99%E6%96%AF%E5%8D%B0%E8%BF%B92.jpg 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/df/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%8E%9B%E7%91%99%E6%96%AF%E5%8D%B0%E8%BF%B92.jpg/456px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%8E%9B%E7%91%99%E6%96%AF%E5%8D%B0%E8%BF%B92.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"1540\" /></a></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "衣着"}], "displaytitle": "<span style=\"display:inline-block\"><span style=\"display: flex;flex-direction: column;\">玛瑙斯印迹 <small style=\"color: grey\">Beneath the Jungle Canopy</small></span></span>"}}